 1.  **Ray Marching (Forward):** For each ray $i$, generate sample positions $\mathbf{p}_k = \mathbf{o}_i + t_k \mathbf{d}_i$ for $k = 0 \dots N-1$, where $t_k$ are evenly spaced depths [S1].
